# Cloudflare Pages redirects
#
# /products/* -> /capabilities/*  (301, permanent)
# The section was renamed when Products & Services became Capabilities.
# These preserve search ranking on the previously-indexed platform pages and
# keep external links and bookmarks working.
#
# NOTE: Cloudflare Pages serves clean URLs and strips the .html extension, so
# an inbound /products/wisdom.html is normalised to /products/wisdom. The splat
# rule below covers both forms; explicit .html rules alone do NOT match.

/products/*    /capabilities/:splat    301
/products      /capabilities/          301
/products/     /capabilities/          301
